{"ticker":"EQT","updated":"2026-11-27T22:51:48Z","profile":{"longName":"EQT Corporation","shortName":"EQT Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","country":"United States","website":"https://www.eqt.com","fullTimeEmployees":1523,"marketCap":32440993792,"trailingPE":12.289101,"forwardPE":15.640268,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5456095,"pegRatio":0.31,"targetMeanPrice":66.5,"targetHighPrice":77.0,"targetLowPrice":52.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":-0.081,"earningsGrowth":-0.17,"grossMargins":0.80401003,"operatingMargins":0.43689,"profitMargins":0.29012,"totalRevenue":9149624320,"beta":0.669,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":68.24,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":47.94,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.32},"summary":"EQT Corporation engages in the exploration, production, gathering, and transmission of hydrocarbons and natural gas. The company sells natural gas, natural gas liquids, and oil to marketers, utilities, and industrial customers located in the Appalachian Basin. It also provides marketing services and contractual pipeline capacity management services, as well as engages in risk management and hedging activities. In addition, it owns and operates propane storage and distribution terminals. The company was formerly known as Equitable Resources Inc. and changed its name to EQT Corporation in February 2009. EQT Corporation was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Canonsburg, Pennsylvania.","summary_zh":"EQT Corporation 從事碳氫化合物和天然氣的勘探、生產、收集和運輸。該公司向阿巴拉契亞盆地的營銷商、公用事業和工業客戶銷售天然氣、天然氣液體和石油。它還提供行銷服務和合約管道容量管理服務，並從事風險管理和對沖活動。此外，它還擁有並經營丙烷儲存和分銷終端。該公司前身為 Equitable Resources Inc.，並於 2009 年 2 月更名為 EQT Corporation。 EQT Corporation 成立於 1888 年，總部位於賓夕法尼亞州卡農斯堡。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣勘探與生產","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":53.96,"h":54.97,"l":53.61,"c":54.46,"v":10445700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":53.99,"h":55.31,"l":53.96,"c":54.43,"v":12118300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":54.25,"h":57.08,"l":54.